# Normalise line endings for text, but never rewrite binaries.
#
# This matters for assets/resume/*.pdf in particular: that file contains no NUL
# bytes, so Git's automatic binary detection classifies it as text and would
# apply CRLF conversion on checkout, corrupting the PDF. Marking the extensions
# explicitly is the reliable fix.

* text=auto

*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4  binary
